{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"M+博物館五周年　今日免費開放指定展覽\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/MPLUS-FREE-261108-1715.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】M+博物館開館五周年，今日免費開放指定展覽。</p><p>不少市民及遊客假日來到M+博物館參觀，部分展覽及公眾節目可以免費參與，訪客毋須預先登記，可從藝術廣場入口進入博物館，有兩個特別展覽則要收費。截至晚上7時，逾2.2萬人次入場。</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:21:57.796765+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T12:48:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T10:35:52.329237+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T10:15:56.784747+00:00","content_hash":"201227e25fb995621b43fd69f34446054dcb73fe232a3f926cfc5ab91f11a14d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:21:57.796765+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}